{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791794820, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T08:47:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T08:48:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791794880, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T08:47:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 28712, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "食安", "content": "我是大安區的台北市民爸爸，國中孩子九月開始非市場機制免費營養午餐，讓我非常擔心，害怕會有食安問題..", "display_name": "大安代表 No.28,712", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T08:47:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 30324, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "其實我很怕蟑螂，走在路上都會被蟑螂嚇到。我知道城市有蟑螂很難避免，但還是想大聲講出來。蟑螂好可怕！！", "display_name": "松山代表 No.30,324", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T08:47:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 12004, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "羅斯福路公車專用地下道不該填平，圓環不該設置內線禁行機車及紅綠燈", "display_name": "大安代表 No.12,004", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T08:47:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 58609, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "可以制定電動滑板車的上路規範嗎？不敢先買，這是處於模糊階段的交通工具", "display_name": "松山代表 No.58,609", "mood": "positive", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T08:47:52+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 14806, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "請現任市長不要再亂砍樹了", "display_name": "松山代表 No.14,806", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 30324, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.30,324", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 12004, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.12,004", "district": "daan